name "mongodb"
description "MongoDB database client implementation"
dependency "vibe-http" version="~>1.0"
targetType "library"
sourcePaths "."
importPaths "."
preGenerateCommands "echo Warning: vibe-d:mongodb is deprecated in favour of the vibe-mongodb package, which provides the same vibe.db.mongo modules. If you depend on vibe-d:mongodb directly, please depend on vibe-mongodb instead. Projects depending on the whole vibe-d package do not need to change anything."
